   12 00000000         ; File      : OS_CPU_A.ASM
   13 00000000         ; Version   : V2.92.11 (ported from the Micrium Cortex-M
                       4 RealView port)
   14 00000000         ;
   15 00000000         ; Notes     : 1) Context switches are deferred to PendSV
                       , the lowest priority exception.
   16 00000000         ;             2) The Cortex-M3 hardware stacks R0-R3, R1
                       2, LR, PC and xPSR automatically.
   17 00000000         ;                This file only saves/restores R4-R11 an
                       d switches PSP.
   18 00000000         ;             3) No floating-point context is saved beca
                       use STM32F103 has no FPU.
